      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Unguided 155mm shell @ 30 km:\nCEP \u2248 267 m  \u2192  ~301 shells needed per target\n= 18.2 tonnes + 959 propellant charges\n\nWhy: wind + velocity spread + Earth rotation.\nError grows with time of flight (~80 s).",
