      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "width": 411.6,
      "height": 157.5,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "KEY TERMS:\n\u2022 STANAG 2916 = standard fuze thread (2-12UN-1A)\n\u2022 S&A = Safe & Arm: arms only after 850g setback\n   + 2,900rpm spin + 100m muzzle distance\n\u2022 Setback = launch g-force (proof of real firing)\n\u2022 EPIAFS = wireless coil that programs the fuze\n\u2022 CEP = accuracy circle (50% of hits inside)\n\u2022 SWaP-C = Size, Weight, Power, Cost (keep LOW)\n\u2022 NavIC = India's own GPS (L5)  \u2022  Fuze \u2260 fuse",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KEY TERMS:\n\u2022 STANAG 2916 = standard fuze thread (2-12UN-1A)\n\u2022 S&A = Safe & Arm: arms only after 850g setback\n   + 2,900rpm spin + 100m muzzle distance\n\u2022 Setback = launch g-force (proof of real firing)\n\u2022 EPIAFS = wireless coil that programs the fuze\n\u2022 CEP = accuracy circle (50% of hits inside)\n\u2022 SWaP-C = Size, Weight, Power, Cost (keep LOW)\n\u2022 NavIC = India's own GPS (L5)  \u2022  Fuze \u2260 fuse",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 126
    },
